 "structural_change": "Compact one-lane partition, same qfd_bl_lane RTL, 259.2x151.2 outline, pins and balanced clock. Predecessor cs2 original+arg1+arg2 routed timing or near timing but DRC20/4/22. Four arg1 residual M4 markers lie exactly at SRAM OBS lip and involve wait/hold data pins. Apply existing whole-GCell macro-edge via guard to reserve interior M5 tracks around each macro edge while preserving exterior pin stub access; shared proven guard adds before GRT and removes after DRT, no exported artificial OBS or timing waiver.",
 "slot_change_request": "Measured compact lane candidate259.2x151.2, 2x2 SRAM grid respecting20um edges/channels, independent root. Sixteen leaves fit3x6 with21.6 channels in820.8x1015.2 envelope; requires die-lead placement and pins before submit. Prior square259.2x172.8 measuredTT332.9/spread98.8, stillboundaryspread defect. Compact height plus local sink clusters is structural next clock measurement.",
